          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Terms and Conditions</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Terms &amp; Conditions<br><br>Welcome to NeuroPrime. These Terms and Conditions govern your use of the NeuroPrime website, available at <a href=\"https://0b7748o1pq522safntwmqkp6l6.hop.clickbank.net/?&traffic_source=website&extclid=abhi135 \" class=\"text-primary\">https://neuroprimeusa.com</a><br><br>By accessing or using this website, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please discontinue use of the website.<br><br>&nbsp;1. Website Use<br><br>Throughout these Terms and Conditions, the terms “you,” “your,” and “user” refer to the person accessing or using the website. The terms “NeuroPrime,” “we,” “us,” and “our” refer to the website and its operators.<br><br>You agree to use this website only for lawful purposes and in a manner that does not violate applicable laws, regulations, or the rights of others.<br><br>2. Cookies<br><br><b>NeuroPrime</b> may use cookies and similar technologies to improve website functionality, understand how visitors use the website, and provide a better browsing experience.<br><br>By continuing to use our website, you consent to the use of cookies in accordance with our Privacy Policy. Third-party service providers, including analytics or advertising partners, may also use cookies according to their own policies.<br><br><b>3. Intellectual Property</b><br><br>Unless otherwise stated, all content appearing on <b>NeuroPrime</b>, including text, graphics, images, logos, designs, and other materials, is owned by or licensed to <b>NeuroPrime</b> and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws.<br><br>You may access and use the website for personal, non-commercial purposes only.<br><br>You may not, without prior written permission:<br><br>* Republish content from <b>NeuroPrime.</b><br>* Sell, rent, or sublicense website content.<br>* Reproduce, duplicate, or copy website materials for commercial purposes.<br>* Redistribute or commercially exploit content from the website.<br>* Modify or create derivative works from our content.<br><br><b>4. User Comments and Submissions</b><br><br>Certain areas of the website may allow users to submit comments, reviews, opinions, or other content.<br><br>Users are responsible for the content they submit. Comments represent the views of the individuals who post them and do not necessarily represent the views of NeuroPrime, its affiliates, employees, or representatives.<br><br><b>NeuroPrime</b> reserves the right, but not the obligation, to monitor, edit, restrict, or remove user-generated content that we believe is inappropriate, offensive, unlawful, misleading, or otherwise violates these Terms and Conditions.<br><br>By submitting content, you confirm that:<br><br>You have the necessary rights and permissions to submit the content.<br>Your content does not infringe the copyright, trademark, privacy, or other rights of any third party.<br>Your content is not defamatory, abusive, obscene, threatening, or unlawful.<br>Your content is not intended to promote unlawful activities or unauthorized commercial solicitations.<br><br>By submitting comments or other content, you grant<b> NeuroPrime</b> a non-exclusive, royalty-free license to use, reproduce, edit, publish, and display that content in connection with the operation and promotion of the website.<br><br>&nbsp;<b>5. Linking to Our Website</b><br><br>Certain organizations may link to the <b>NeuroPrime</b> website without obtaining prior written permission, including government agencies, search engines, news organizations, and recognized online directories, provided that the link is lawful and does not create a misleading impression of sponsorship, endorsement, or affiliation.<br><br>Other organizations may request permission to link to our website. Requests may be reviewed individually.<br><br>A link to<b> NeuroPrime</b> must not:<br><br>* Be deceptive or misleading.<br>* Falsely suggest sponsorship, endorsement, or partnership.<br>* Appear on a website containing unlawful, defamatory, obscene, or harmful material.<br>* Infringe the rights of <b>NeuroPrime </b>or any third party.<br><br>Approved organizations may link to our website using our company name, the relevant website URL, or another accurate description that fits naturally within the context of their content.<br><br>Use of the <b>NeuroPrime</b> logo or other branded artwork requires prior written permission or an appropriate trademark license.<br><br>&nbsp;6. iFrames<br><br>You may not create frames or embedded displays around <b>NeuroPrime</b> webpages that alter the appearance, functionality, or presentation of our website without prior written permission.<br><br>7. Third-Party Content and Links<br><br>NeuroPrime may provide links to third-party websites for convenience or informational purposes. We do not control these external websites and are not responsible for their content, availability, privacy practices, policies, products, or services.<br><br>The presence of a third-party link does not necessarily constitute an endorsement or recommendation by NeuroPrime.<br><br>You should review the Privacy Policy and Terms of Service of any external website before providing personal information or engaging in a transaction.<br><br>8. Content Liability<br><br>We are not responsible for content published on third-party websites that link to or reference NeuroPrime.<br><br>You agree not to use links to NeuroPrime in connection with content that is unlawful, defamatory, obscene, fraudulent, misleading, or that infringes upon the rights of another person or organization.<br><br>9. Privacy<br><br>Your use of NeuroPrime is also subject to our Privacy Policy. Please review our Privacy Policy to understand how information may be collected, used, and protected.<br><br>10. Reservation of Rights<br><br><b>NeuroPrime</b> reserves the right to request the removal of any link to our website at any time. If requested, the link must be removed promptly.<br><br>We also reserve the right to modify these Terms and Conditions and our linking policies at any time. Continued use of the website following such changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.<br><br><b>11. Removal of Links</b><br><br>If you believe a link appearing on our website is inappropriate or potentially problematic, you may contact us and let us know.<br><br>We may review requests to remove links at our discretion, although we are not obligated to remove a link or respond to every request.<br><br><b>12. Website Accuracy and Availability</b><br><br>We make reasonable efforts to provide useful and accurate information on the website. However, we do not guarantee that all information is complete, current, accurate, or error-free.<br><br>We also do not guarantee that the website will always be available, uninterrupted, secure, or free from technical errors.<br><br><b>13. Disclaimer of Warranties</b><br><br>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, <b>NeuroPrime</b> provides the website and its content on an “as is” and “as available” basis.<br><br>We make no warranties or representations regarding the accuracy, completeness, reliability, availability, or suitability of the website or its content.<br><br>Nothing in these Terms and Conditions is intended to exclude or limit liability that cannot legally be excluded under applicable law, including liability for fraud, fraudulent misrepresentation, or death or personal injury caused by negligence where such limitations are prohibited.<br><br><b>14. Limitation of Liability</b><br><br>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, NeuroPrime shall not be responsible for losses or damages arising from your use of, or inability to use, the website or reliance on information provided through the website.<br><br>This may include, where legally permitted, direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or other losses.<br><br>Nothing in these Terms and Conditions limits any rights or protections that cannot legally be excluded under applicable law.<br><br><b>15. Changes to These Terms</b><br><br><b>NeuroPrime</b> may update or modify these Terms and Conditions from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page, and the updated version will become effective when published.<br><br>We encourage you to review these Terms periodically to remain informed about any changes.<br><br><b>16. Contact Us</b><br><br>If you have questions about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us through the contact information provided on the <b>NeuroPrime website.</b><br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
