          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Disclaimer</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Disclaimer<br><br>If you have any questions or need additional information about this Disclaimer, please contact us at info@NeuroPrime.com mailto : info@NeuroPrime.com<br><br>All information provided on the <b>NeuroPrime website</b> — <a href=\"https://0b7748o1pq522safntwmqkp6l6.hop.clickbank.net/?&traffic_source=website&extclid=abhi135 \" class=\"text-primary\">https://neuroprimeusa.com</a>— is published in good faith and is intended for general informational purposes only. While we make reasonable efforts to keep the information accurate and up to date, <b>NeuroPrime</b> makes no guarantees or warranties regarding the completeness, accuracy, reliability, or suitability of any information presented on the website.<br><br>Any action you take based on the information found on this website is at your own discretion and risk. <b>NeuroPrime</b> shall not be held responsible for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential loss or damage arising from the use of our website or reliance on the information provided.<br><br><b>External Links</b><br><br>Our website may contain links to third-party websites for additional information or convenience. Although we aim to link to reputable and relevant resources, we do not control the content, privacy practices, policies, or availability of external websites.<br><br>The inclusion of any third-party link does not necessarily mean that <b>NeuroPrime</b> endorses or recommends the content, products, or services available on that website. External websites may change their content or policies without notice, and we may not always be able to immediately remove outdated or unavailable links.<br><br>Once you leave the <b>NeuroPrime</b> website, you should review the Privacy Policy and Terms of Service of any external website you visit before providing personal information or making a purchase.<br><br><b>Health Disclaimer</b><br><br>The information provided on this website is for educational and informational purposes only and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease or medical condition. <b>NeuroPrime</b> is a dietary supplement and is not intended to replace professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.<br><br>Always consult a qualified healthcare professional before starting any new dietary supplement, particularly if you have a medical condition, are pregnant or breastfeeding, or take prescription medications.<br><br><b>Consent</b><br><br>By using the <b>NeuroPrime </b>website, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Disclaimer and agree to its terms.<br><br><b>Updates to This Disclaimer</b><br><br>We may update, modify, or revise this Disclaimer from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page and will become effective once published. We encourage you to review this page periodically to stay informed about any updates.<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
