        "meta_descr": "Privacy Policy for CogniSurge"
      },
      "components": [
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Privacy Policy</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">&nbsp;Privacy Policy<br><br>Welcome to NeuroPrime.<br><br>At NeuroPrime, accessible at <a href=\"https://0b7748o1pq522safntwmqkp6l6.hop.clickbank.net/?&traffic_source=website&extclid=abhi135 \" class=\"text-primary\">https://neuroprimeusa.com/</a>, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting the information you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains what information may be collected through our website, how it may be used, and the choices available to you.<br><br>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, please contact us at [contact@NeuroPrime.com](mailto:contact@NeuroPrime.com).<br><br>Information We Collect<br><br>When you visit or use the NeuroPrime website, certain information may be collected automatically. This may include your IP address, browser type, device information, Internet Service Provider, date and time of your visit, referring and exit pages, and general website activity.<br><br>We may use this information to understand how visitors use our website, improve website performance, identify technical issues, analyze trends, and maintain website security.<br><br>Where appropriate, information that does not directly identify you may be used for analytical and statistical purposes.<br><br>Log Files<br><br>NeuroPrime may use standard log files as part of website hosting and analytics services. These files can record information such as IP addresses, browser type, ISP information, timestamps, referring pages, exit pages, and click activity.<br><br>This information is generally used for website administration, analyzing traffic patterns, improving the user experience, and understanding how visitors interact with our website.<br><br>Cookies and Similar Technologies<br><br>NeuroPrime may use cookies, web beacons, pixels, and similar technologies to improve your browsing experience.<br><br>Cookies may help us remember visitor preferences, understand which pages are visited, analyze website traffic, and improve the functionality and content of our website.<br><br>You can manage or disable cookies through your individual browser settings. Please note that disabling certain cookies may affect how some features of the website function.<br><br>Advertising and Third-Party Services<br><br><b>NeuroPrime</b> may work with third-party advertising, analytics, or technology providers. These providers may use cookies, JavaScript, web beacons, pixels, or similar technologies when their advertisements or services appear on our website.<br><br>These technologies may allow third parties to receive information such as your IP address and browser information. They may use this information to measure advertising performance, understand website activity, or provide more relevant advertising.<br><br><b>NeuroPrime</b> does not control cookies or tracking technologies placed by independent third-party providers. Their collection and use of information are governed by their own privacy policies.<br><br><b>Google Advertising Services</b><br><br>If Google advertising services are used on the <b>NeuroPrime website</b>, Google and its partners may use cookies or similar technologies to provide and measure advertising.<br><br>You can learn more about Google's advertising and privacy practices through Google's official policies and settings.<br><br>Third-Party Privacy Policies<br><br>This Privacy Policy applies only to the <b>NeuroPrime website</b>. It does not apply to third-party websites, advertising platforms, services, or applications that may be linked to or accessible through our website.<br><br>We encourage you to review the privacy policies of third-party websites before providing them with personal information. <b>NeuroPrime </b>is not responsible for the privacy practices, content, or security of external websites.<br><br>How We Use Information<br><br>Information collected through the website may be used to:<br><br>* Operate and maintain the <b>NeuroPrime website.</b><br>* Improve website functionality and user experience.<br>* Understand website traffic and visitor behavior.<br>* Respond to questions, requests, or customer inquiries.<br>* Monitor and improve website security.<br>* Detect and prevent fraudulent or unauthorized activity.<br>* Analyze and improve our products, services, and online content.<br>* Comply with applicable legal requirements.<br><br><b>Children's Privacy</b><br><br><b>NeuroPrime </b>does not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13.<br><br>We encourage parents and guardians to supervise their children's online activities and help them understand the importance of protecting personal information online.<br><br>If you believe that a child under 13 has provided personal information through our website, please contact us. We will take reasonable steps to review the information and remove it from our records where appropriate.<br><br><b>Online Privacy Policy Only</b><br><br>This Privacy Policy applies specifically to information collected through the NeuroPrime website and does not necessarily apply to information collected offline or through other channels.<br><br><b>Your Consent<br></b><br>By using the <b>NeuroPrime website</b>, you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Privacy Policy and consent to the collection and use of information as described here.<br><br>Your continued use of the website following any updates to this Privacy Policy will constitute acceptance of the revised policy, where permitted by applicable law.<br><br><b>Updates to This Privacy Policy</b><br><br>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices, services, technology, or applicable requirements.<br><br>Any updates will be posted on this page. We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy periodically to stay informed about how we handle information.<br><br>Contact Us<br><br>If you have questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:<br><br>Email: contact@NeuroPrime.com (mailto:contact@NeuroPrime.com)<br>Website: https://NeuroPrimeus.com/<br><br>More Products : <a href=\"https://www.us-en-dentalbiome.com/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">DentaBiome</a> | <a href=\"https://www.prostaavive.store/\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\">Prostavive</a> | <a href=\"https://www.thergeniuswave.com/\" class=\"text-primary\">The Genius Wave</a> | <a href=\"https://us-prodentim.vercel.app/\" class=\"text-primary\">Prodentim&nbsp;</a></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
